{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "静岡県出身\n櫻坂46 大沼晶保です🐟🌻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日の朝！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ラヴィット！出演させていただきます🐰✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみだー！\nぜひみてねー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "バズリズム LIVE\nありがとうございました✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mob3JgF8I.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おでこだしてみたー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうかな？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobgqObwB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りこちゃんが褒めてくれたー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こないだ\n一緒にぷぐまるのおさんぽとお寿司行って\nめっちゃ嬉し楽しかったんだ〜〜〜🐕 ͗ ͗"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mob77TfI9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽屋が隣の席だったるんちゃんとー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもなーんでも笑ってくれて\n優しい楽しい🌱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして遅くなってしまいましたが、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「木枯らしは泣かない」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVが公開されました🍂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "冷たい風が染みる\n今の時期にぴったりな曲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "強がるのも\n人生には必要だなって思うんです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この曲がたくさんの方に届きますように*･"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobri3BjJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mob45XEDK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けんか強そうな衣装👊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めて泥メイクしたー✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobHbW0pc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobwOzW14.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふわふわな衣装☁️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mob0DZ6Vp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ごろの写真いっぱい撮ったんだ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobkAz6Aj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "レインボー帽子かわいい🌈"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobIJK4w3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな大好きいのちゅけ🐄🌈"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MV撮影の帰りの車で\nなんか寂しくてずっとごろと話してて\n一回家帰った後も"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "深夜なのにもう一度私の家に集合して"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しかも！\n疲れてるはずなのにわざわざ初めてチャリをレンタルしてチャリで来たんです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "面白い女ですよね🦒"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気づいたら次の日のぽかぽかが\n始まる時間になっていました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "残り少ない時間も\nいーっぱい笑い合いたいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぷぐまるもごろのことだーいすきなので\nいっぱい会いにきてほしいです🐶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後にひょっこりぷぐ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202511/mobL06BQV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このぷぐの表情人間みたいでお気に入り笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またすぐブログ書くねー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あきぽ🐟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたは175cm沼